ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa152: CLOSED_SHELL: 10×10×1 mm box; top face (z=1) outer loop 10×10 plus inner FACE_BOUND wire whose four corners all collapse to a single point (1,1,1) — zero-area loop; ShapeAnalysis_CheckSmallFace::CheckSpotFace computes area=0.0 and classifies it as 'definitely small' without checking manufacturing tolerance; cannot distinguish genuine degeneracy from valid near-zero manufacturing feature; defect IS on live CLOSED_SHELL traversal path */
